# Pipeline intermediates. The sheets (assets/sprites/<name>.png) and
# manifest.json ARE committed: they are the shipped artwork, and regenerating
# them costs credits and re-rolls the sampler, so they must never be treated as
# reproducible build output. The per-frame PNGs and base64 dumps are derivable
# from the sheets and exist only for inspection.
assets/sprites/*-[0-9][0-9].png
assets/sprites/*.frames.json

test/*.png
